"Ardea": {"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/ItaliaLazioArdea_MuraAggere.jpg/1920px-ItaliaLazioArdea_MuraAggere.jpg","title":"The walls of Ardea","desc":"A length of the ancient tufa wall of Ardea, with the rampart mound behind it.","credit":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:ItaliaLazioArdea_MuraAggere.jpg","alt":"A long low wall of squared brown tufa blocks with a taller mass at its centre, overgrown along the top."},
