"Animal_style": {"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Placa_en_forma_de_c%C3%A9rvol_tombat%2C_trobada_al_t%C3%BAmul_de_Kostromskoy_a_Kuban%2C_segle_VII_aC.JPG/1920px-Placa_en_forma_de_c%C3%A9rvol_tombat%2C_trobada_al_t%C3%BAmul_de_Kostromskoy_a_Kuban%2C_segle_VII_aC.JPG","title":"The golden stag from Kostromskaya","desc":"A gold plaque of the 7th century BCE from a barrow in the Kuban, found at the centre of an iron shield.","credit":"Photograph by Joanbanjo, CC BY-SA 3.0, via Wikimedia Commons. https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Placa_en_forma_de_c%C3%A9rvol_tombat%2C_trobada_al_t%C3%BAmul_de_Kostromskoy_a_Kuban%2C_segle_VII_aC.JPG","alt":"A gold plaque of a stag lying with its legs tucked beneath it, muzzle stretched forward and a row of scrolled antler tines sweeping back along its spine."},
"Bosporan_Kingdom": {"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Panticapaeum_01.jpg/1920px-Panticapaeum_01.jpg","title":"The ruins of Panticapaeum above Kerch","desc":"Foundations on the slope of Mount Mithridat, the acropolis hill of the Bosporan capital, with the modern city below.","credit":"Photograph by Dmytro Petishkin, CC BY 4.0, via Wikimedia Commons. https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Panticapaeum_01.jpg","alt":"Grassy terraces scattered with cut stone blocks and wall footings on a hillside, with roofs and trees of a modern town spreading across the valley below."},
