"Kurgan": {"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/06/Solokha_barrow._V_c._BC_-_panoramio.jpg/960px-Solokha_barrow._V_c._BC_-_panoramio.jpg","title":"The Solokha barrow above the Dnieper","desc":"A Scythian royal mound of the 5th century BCE in southern Ukraine, standing well above ploughed fields.","credit":"Photograph by Валерий Дед, CC BY 3.0, via Wikimedia Commons. https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Solokha_barrow._V_c._BC_-_panoramio.jpg","alt":"A broad grass-covered mound rising out of an otherwise flat ploughed field, with a track curving past its foot."},
