"Korea": {"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Korea_2004-01-04_NASA_MODIS_Aqua_250m.jpg/1280px-Korea_2004-01-04_NASA_MODIS_Aqua_250m.jpg","title":"Korea from orbit in winter","desc":"A satellite view taken on 4 January 2004, with snow on the northern mountains and ice along the shallow western coast.","credit":"Jeff Schmaltz, MODIS Rapid Response Team, NASA/GSFC, public domain, via Wikimedia Commons. https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Korea_2004-01-04_NASA_MODIS_Aqua_250m.jpg","alt":"A true-colour satellite image of a peninsula, its northern half snow-covered, between a pale sea on the west and a dark one on the east."},
