"Korean-style_bronze_dagger": {"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/Korean_Bronze_dagger_and_mirror._Jangsu._Jin_Period._National_Museum_of_Korea.jpg/1280px-Korean_Bronze_dagger_and_mirror._Jangsu._Jin_Period._National_Museum_of_Korea.jpg","title":"A Korean-style bronze dagger and mirror","desc":"The slender blade with a separate handle that follows the Liaoning form, here with a knobbed bronze mirror.","credit":"Ismoon, CC BY-SA 4.0, via Wikimedia Commons. https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Korean_Bronze_dagger_and_mirror._Jangsu._Jin_Period._National_Museum_of_Korea.jpg","alt":"A long narrow bronze blade mounted upright above a small dark bronze disc."},
