"Lacquerware": {"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/Pantings_on_Lacquar_Basket_Lo-lang.jpg/1280px-Pantings_on_Lacquar_Basket_Lo-lang.jpg","title":"Painted figures on the lacquer basket from Lelang","desc":"Bands of small painted figures from a lacquered basket recovered near Pyongyang, the best known piece of its kind.","credit":"Unknown authorUnknown author, Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons. https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pantings_on_Lacquar_Basket_Lo-lang.jpg","alt":"Two long bands of small seated figures in orange and red on a dark purple-blue lacquer ground."},
