"Confessing_Church": {"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/26/Ausweis_der_Bekennenden_Gemeinde_%2827818348526%29.jpg","title":"A Confessing congregation's membership card","desc":"An identity card issued to a member of a Confessing congregation, headed with the movement's motto that the congregation stands under the word.","credit":"Archiv der Evangelischen Kirche im Rheinland. Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons. https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ausweis_der_Bekennenden_Gemeinde_%2827818348526%29.jpg","alt":"A small printed card in German with a cross and handwritten entries."},
"Conscription": {"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e5/Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-2007-0928-502%2C_Berlin%2C_Vereidigung_von_Rekruten.jpg","title":"Recruits taking the oath, 1935","desc":"Newly conscripted German soldiers being sworn in at Berlin on 7 November 1935, the first class called up after conscription was reintroduced.","credit":"Bundesarchiv, Bild 183-2007-0928-502, CC BY-SA 3.0 de, via Wikimedia Commons. https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-2007-0928-502,_Berlin,_Vereidigung_von_Rekruten.jpg","alt":"A long line of soldiers in helmets and greatcoats with right hands raised before an officer."},
