"Rome-Berlin_Axis": {"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/81/Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-H28790%2C_M%C3%BCnchener_Abkommen%2C_Hitler_und_Mussolini.jpg","title":"Hitler and Mussolini at Munich, 1938","desc":"The two leaders descending a flight of steps side by side, followed by officers of their delegations.","credit":"Bundesarchiv, Bild 183-H28790, CC BY-SA 3.0 DE, via Wikimedia Commons. https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bundesarchiv_Bild_183-H28790,_M%C3%BCnchener_Abkommen,_Hitler_und_Mussolini.jpg","alt":"Black and white photograph of two men in dark uniforms walking down wide marble steps, with uniformed men standing on the landing above."},
