"Ming_dynasty": {"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/A_Seated_Portrait_of_Ming_Emperor_Taizu.jpg/1920px-A_Seated_Portrait_of_Ming_Emperor_Taizu.jpg","title":"The founder enthroned","desc":"A seated portrait of the rebel commander who took the throne in 1368 and reigned as Hongwu.","credit":"Unknown artist, public domain, via Wikimedia Commons. https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:A_Seated_Portrait_of_Ming_Emperor_Taizu.jpg","alt":"A hanging scroll portrait of a stout seated ruler in a plain yellow robe and a black cap."},
