"Kyzyl": {"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Kyzyl%2C_Tuva%2C_Siberia%2C_Russia_1.jpg/1920px-Kyzyl%2C_Tuva%2C_Siberia%2C_Russia_1.jpg","title":"The Royal Hunt monument, Kyzyl","desc":"A bronze group on the river front of the city, two mounted archers riding down with hounds and a hawk.","credit":"RussianTrueToType, CC BY 4.0, https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kyzyl%2C_Tuva%2C_Siberia%2C_Russia_1.jpg","alt":"A bronze sculpture on a stone plinth of two armoured riders on galloping horses, one drawing a bow, with running hounds around them against a blue sky."},
