"Birobidzhan": {"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/eb/Birobidzhan%2C_Jewish_Autonomous_Oblast%2C_Russia_-_panoramio.jpg/1920px-Birobidzhan%2C_Jewish_Autonomous_Oblast%2C_Russia_-_panoramio.jpg","title":"The entrance sign at Birobidzhan","desc":"The sign at the edge of the town, which gives its name in Cyrillic and in Yiddish.","credit":"Rusik_z, CC BY-SA 3.0, https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Birobidzhan%2C_Jewish_Autonomous_Oblast%2C_Russia_-_panoramio.jpg","alt":"A white concrete sign spanning a roadside, the town name in Cyrillic on the left and in Hebrew letters on the right, with a bronze emblem above the centre."},
