"Pskov": {"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/31/Pskov_kremlin_pano.jpeg/1920px-Pskov_kremlin_pano.jpeg","title":"Inside the Pskov kreml","desc":"The Trinity Cathedral and the belfry within the walls of the Krom, in winter.","credit":"Stass, Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons. https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pskov_kremlin_pano.jpeg","alt":"A very wide winter panorama taken inside a walled fortress: a tall white cathedral with black and gold domes at the centre, a white belfry beside it, low white outbuildings and long stone walls with towers curving away on both sides over snow-covered ground."},
