"Yoshkar-Ola": {"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/%D0%9F%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B0_%D0%B3%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B0_%D0%99%D0%BE%D1%88%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%80-%D0%9E%D0%BB%D1%8B%2C_%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B4_%D0%BD%D0%B0_%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80.jpg/1920px-%D0%9F%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B0_%D0%B3%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B0_%D0%99%D0%BE%D1%88%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%80-%D0%9E%D0%BB%D1%8B%2C_%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B4_%D0%BD%D0%B0_%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80.jpg","title":"Yoshkar-Ola looking north","desc":"A rooftop panorama at dusk, with the river and its bridges on the left and the modern housing blocks and woods of the north of the city beyond.","credit":"Bulivif, CC BY-SA 3.0, via Wikimedia Commons. https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%D0%9F%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B0_%D0%B3%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B0_%D0%99%D0%BE%D1%88%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%80-%D0%9E%D0%BB%D1%8B%2C_%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B4_%D0%BD%D0%B0_%D1%81%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80.jpg","alt":"A very wide rooftop view over a city at dusk: a river with two bridges to the left, long apartment blocks in the centre and woodland stretching to the horizon."},
