"Venus_of_Lespugue": {"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e0/V%C3%A9nus_de_Lespugue_Gravettien_Mus%C3%A9e_de_l%27Homme_04022018_2.jpg/1280px-V%C3%A9nus_de_Lespugue_Gravettien_Mus%C3%A9e_de_l%27Homme_04022018_2.jpg","title":"The figure in three-quarter view","desc":"The ivory figure from Lespugue seen in three-quarter view in its case at the Musée de l'Homme, Paris.","credit":"Vassil, CC0, https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:V%C3%A9nus_de_Lespugue_Gravettien_Mus%C3%A9e_de_l%27Homme_04022018_2.jpg","alt":"A dark mottled ivory figure of a woman seen from the side against a shadowy background: a small head bowed forward with fine incised hair, a thin arm resting on the breasts, and chipped, broken rounded masses of breast and hip above a copper-coloured mount"},
"Venus_of_Brassempouy": {"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Dame_de_Brassempouy_profil_droit.JPG/960px-Dame_de_Brassempouy_profil_droit.JPG","title":"The ivory head from Brassempouy in three-quarter view","desc":"The ivory head from Brassempouy seen from its right side, on its mount in the Musée d’Archéologie nationale.","credit":"Chatsam, CC BY-SA 3.0, https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dame_de_Brassempouy_profil_droit.JPG","alt":"A tiny yellowish ivory head of a woman seen from her right side, held on a thin metal rod: a small face with a straight nose and no mouth, under a checked pattern of crossing grooves that covers the back of the head and hangs down past the neck"},
"Venus_of_Laussel": {"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Mus%C3%A9e_d%27Aquitaine_-_Collection_pr%C3%A9histoire_05.jpg/1280px-Mus%C3%A9e_d%27Aquitaine_-_Collection_pr%C3%A9histoire_05.jpg","title":"The Laussel relief in the Musée d’Aquitaine","desc":"The limestone relief from Laussel on display in the prehistory rooms of the Musée d’Aquitaine in Bordeaux.","credit":"Tylwyth Eldar, CC BY-SA 4.0, https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mus%C3%A9e_d%27Aquitaine_-_Collection_pr%C3%A9histoire_05.jpg","alt":"A tall rough slab of pale brown stone on a dark background, carved in shallow relief with a heavy naked woman who raises a curved horn marked with short cuts in one hand and rests the other on her belly, faint reddish colour showing on the body"},
